OL,3,ATrump says Ukraine and Russia have
OL,4,Aagreed 'energy ceasefire'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has said Russia and
OL,7,FUkraine have agreed to an "energy
OL,8,Fceasefire" in the war between the two
OL,9,Fnations.
OL,11,FThe US president provided few details,
OL,12,Faside from it being "effective
OL,13,Fimmediately". Neither Kyiv nor Moscow
OL,14,Fhave so far commented. The BBC has
OL,15,Fasked the White House for more details.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
